sentences.t:
alter Amazoniam pharetram plenamque sagittis
Threïciis, lato quam circum amplectitur auro
balteus et tereti subnectit fibula gemma;

sentences.l:
the second, an Amazonian quiver and one full of arrows
Thracian, which around embraces with broad gold
a belt, and with a rounded gem fastens up a clasp;

So he says, and a twofold honour of the fight sets forth,
for the victor a bullock, veiled with gold and ribbons,
a sword and a distinguished helmet, consolations for the beaten.
